   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No approach has been compared with another (O'Cathain 2019). Design one goal by several registered methods (M01 – M05), review them (④ ⑤, T0 to T2), and let the Exp (T4) answer:\ndoes reading more give better designs, and do our own insights beat the literature?",
